          <name>RAFT_STATE_FOLLOWER</name>
          <initializer>= 1</initializer>
          <briefdescription>
<para>Can&apos;t write. </para>          </briefdescription>
          <detaileddescription>
<para>Can only accept data from a leader. Node in this state either monitors an existing leader, or there is an on-going election and the node voted for another node, or it can&apos;t be a candidate and does not do anything. </para>          </detaileddescription>
        </enumvalue>
