          <initializer>= 2</initializer>
          <briefdescription>
<para>The node can&apos;t write. </para>          </briefdescription>
          <detaileddescription>
<para>There is an active election, in which the node voted for self. Now it waits for election outcome. </para>          </detaileddescription>
        </enumvalue>
